    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really worried about the cost of the clinic. if i can't go tonight, can i just take some ibuprofen and put some antibiotic ointment on it to make sure it doesn't get infected? would that be enough to manage it at home for now?",
      "source": "evaluator"
